  "content": "\n\n<h2><strong>精緻火把！</strong></h2>\n<hr>\n<p>此材質包將所有火把模型改為嶄新精美的外觀。<br>內含動態材質！<br>手持時外觀也更為出色。<br><br><em><strong>適用於原版遊戲</strong></em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050626/description_ed772def-f7fc-4c88-bb51-f82b81b15d09.gif\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050626/description_364eadbc-2791-4ce1-8656-ae0872744885.gif\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050626/description_dde5862d-3c3e-4bae-aa1c-edcce51a394e.gif\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050626/description_92c22e36-dfec-4864-ac4b-832e6fe0eb8a.gif\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>",
